<title>NEW ZEALAND: Caltex reverses NZ wholesale petrol price.</title>
<headline>Caltex reverses NZ wholesale petrol price.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Caltex said on Thursday it had reversed a rise in wholesale petrol and diesel prices announced on August 20.</p>
<p>It said the net effect of the rise in crude oil prices since the end of January was 2.9 cents per litre.</p>
<p>But other companies failed to match Caltex's price hike.</p>
<p>Caltex said it reversed the hike &quot;in response to market prices&quot; to remain competitive.</p>
<p>-- Wellington newsroom 64 4 4734 746</p>
</text>
